# Vision Transformer (ViT) Project

This repository implements a Vision Transformer (ViT) for image classification, trained on CIFAR-10. The code is modularized for production use and includes visualization tools for patches, embeddings, and attention maps.

## Setup

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/saurabhsensai/vit-project.git
   cd vit-project

2. Install dependencies:

    ```bash 
    pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Train the model:
    ```bash
    python scripts/train.py


You can update the according to your needs and datasets just update the `vit/dataset.py` acccording to your needs. 
